    "description": {
      "content": "Target provides partner APIs for product catalog access, inventory availability, order management, and store information. These APIs enable technology partners and affiliates to integrate with Target's retail platform. The Redsky aggregation platform powers client-managed REST APIs built on GraphQL queries covering product, price, promotion, and fulfillment data.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Target Developer Support",
